, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sora estrutura t\u00edtulos, Plus Jakarta Sans atende leitura e controles, e JetBrains Mono distingue nota\u00e7\u00e3o, f\u00f3rmulas e c\u00f3digo.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "design_bito", "label": "Bito", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN.md", "source_location": "## Overview", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O personagem oficial acolhe a explora\u00e7\u00e3o sem disputar espa\u00e7o com a quest\u00e3o. Na Home, h\u00e1 reserva real de 104px acima do texto de loja/mochila; Bito tamb\u00e9m comp\u00f5e o login.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "design_estados_das_etapas", "label": "Estados das etapas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN.md", "source_location": "### Cards / Containers", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O percurso apresenta liga\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00f3s, n\u00famero, estado e a\u00e7\u00e3o contextual com contraste pr\u00f3prio. Banner e n\u00f3 atual usam gradiente de disciplina; conclus\u00e3o usa Menta. Bloqueio e conclus\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m s\u00e3o informados por texto, \u00edcone ou estado sem\u00e2ntico.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "design_mapa_de_etapas", "label": "Mapa de etapas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN.md", "source_location": "### Cards / Containers", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "design_navegacao_responsiva", "label": "Navega\u00e7\u00e3o responsiva", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN.md", "source_location": "## Layout", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A navega\u00e7\u00e3o usa a lateral a partir de 1025 px. Em telas menores, cabe\u00e7alho fixo e barra inferior mant\u00eam os acessos principais dispon\u00edveis.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "design_t_de_nos_c